## Stack index

Full map: `.cursor/skills/code-review/reference/stack-map.md`

| Files | Skill | Rule |
|-------|-------|------|
| `.js`, `.jsx`, `.mjs` | `javascript-advanced/SKILL.md` | `javascript-stack.mdc` |
| `.ts`, `.tsx` | `typescript/SKILL.md` | `typescript-stack.mdc` |
| `.jsx`, `.tsx` (UI) | also `react/SKILL.md` | also `react-stack.mdc` |
| `.js`, `.mjs` (APIs) | also `nodejs/SKILL.md` | also `nodejs-stack.mdc` |
| `.py` | `python/SKILL.md` | `python-stack.mdc` |
| `.php` | `php/SKILL.md` | `php-stack.mdc` |
| `.dart` | `flutter/SKILL.md` | `flutter-stack.mdc` |
| `.sql` | `database-common/SKILL.md` + dialect | matching `*-stack.mdc` |
| `.html`, `.css`, `.scss` | — | `rules.mdc`; `front-end-cursor-rules.mdc` |
| `.json` | — | `rules.mdc`; `typescript-stack.mdc` for `tsconfig*.json` |
| `.sh` | — | `rules.mdc` (security, quoting, fail-fast) |
| `.env`, `.env.*` | — | `rules.mdc` §Security — **Blocker** on committed secrets |
| `.xml` | — | `rules.mdc` §Security (manifests, permissions) |

Extended stacks (Shopify, Electron, `.cjs`, MongoDB) are out of scope unless the user expands.

## Auto-fix loop (MUST follow after every review)

IF any Blocker or Major found:
  - Apply the Fix directly to the file at the stated line
  - Do NOT ask for confirmation — fix immediately
  - Re-run full review from Step 0
  - Repeat until zero Blockers and zero Majors remain
  - Max 3 loops — if still unresolved after 3 passes output:
    ⚠ Manual review needed — could not auto-fix: [list remaining issues]
  - On clean pass output:
    ✅ All clear — Approved — ready to push

IF only Minor / Nit / zero findings:
  - Output: ✅ Approved — ready to push
  - List Minor/Nit under Follow-ups only, never block push